&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Enqu&#234;teur.html&quot; title=&quot;L&amp;#39;enqu&#234;teur&quot;&gt;Enqu&#234;teur&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/b&gt; Ajoute un bonus de +1/4 aux tests de &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Perception.html&quot; title=&quot;Perception&quot;&gt;Perception&lt;/a&gt; effectu&#233;s sous terre et un bonus de +1/2 &#224; l’aptitude &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Enqu&#234;teur.html#SENSDESPIEGES&quot; title=&quot;L&amp;#39;enqu&#234;teur&quot;&gt;sens des pi&#232;ges&lt;/a&gt; vis-&#224;-vis des pi&#232;ges de pierre.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/Wiki/Pathfinder-RPG.Manuel des races (Contenu).ashx&quot; style=&quot;float:right; padding: 4px 4px 2px 8px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img title=&quot;Source : Advanced Race Guide, Elves of Golarion, Gnomes of Golarion, Goblins of Golarion, Halflings of Golarion, Humans of Golarion, Dwarves of Golarion, Orcs of Golarion/Manuel des races&quot; class=&quot;opachover&quot; src=&quot;/Wiki/public/Upload/Illustrations/Logos/logoMR.gif&quot; style=&quot;opacity: 0.7&quot; loop=&quot;infinite&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/Wiki/Pathfinder-RPG.Manuel des joueurs - R&#232;gles avanc&#233;es (Contenu).ashx&quot; style=&quot;float:right; padding: 4px 4px 2px 8px;&quot;&gt;
